{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:52 2026-10-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:52 2026-10-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:52 2026-10-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"「朗日雪峰」轉場爆大冷\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/e987e03db1bce6751b7219f23794580b/2026-10/r2_5.jpg\"/><p>方嘉柏馬房的「朗日雪峰」，過往在谷草千二米上陣三次，取得一冠一季，可是該駒今晚再在同程贏馬，賠率仍然有四十九倍，方嘉柏今季頭馬數字上升至十場。</p><p>練馬師方嘉柏在快活谷成績優秀，有「黑夜之神」美譽，今晚第二場「朗日雪峰」轉場跑曾勝的谷草千二米，在奧爾民胯下爆出四十九倍大冷門勝出。</p><p>賽後馬主石達傑說：「我以為『朗日雪峰』上場很有機會勝出，經過上場熱身後，馬兒狀態更進一步，很開心可以補中，我認為牠加分後上四班，仍然具競爭力。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1485073a41f313c9d434875b84edcbb3/2026-10/0a50c478-dacd-4b42-b355-58af711a93f6.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9eca9f044166e926f1ab3d0178322062/2026-10/2f193bb6-e80e-486b-9c4d-7e33bb496a90.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f0a440dca7f41c278d0f17b7fcbda0d1/2026-10/4f4dfb6a-39c8-4668-9edd-ba51862218de.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/984d43ba2c6910382a25d871c76e6c5c/2026-10/6bbe8338-54fb-414d-94a2-d68de1bb07af.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/04987a947ec53d6d1b84747ebf840ab3/2026-10/8c692aa9-5998-4b01-be93-e9b5ab9babbc.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2b4d08936f526fa39afc3aac737a192d/2026-10/9a1cc7d4-9145-4e56-b85f-e8ecdac1f9a0.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0a62c71ca818fe29e72f148ff65ee30c/2026-10/9e939f20-7456-4264-8b4f-d25d2a52a7f6.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ba9fae5a1a47bacbe624a532a537259a/2026-10/383a286e-fdaf-4c9e-a345-03602b113503.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3bc851d90492c36c3f8b34d25e06f774/2026-10/856cec70-ece1-4b81-8ee7-b7641f569870.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/035ce174bd4d47a20a67337569c1316c/2026-10/916c09e2-7d7a-40ca-8d1b-625544f86b3d.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/179c67c15460d0f6c07288abbf26c901/2026-10/bac13018-99cf-4b53-b515-e5c1c2aaa5ae.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fd805d5d5f7eaf8777e1a0bb6221cf39/2026-10/f37e48a4-c158-4566-bc2d-91e2e017ced8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ea4a31ad9883a8a8038f7d4516364e4f/2026-10/fd4277e0-9a28-4194-9fcf-c44321bbfe95.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T12:00:29.096244+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":14,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T11:52:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T18:38:27.812087+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T11:57:50.902278+00:00","content_hash":"e31c35035fb6ca684ac14c9aebf3253ac03db4cb88d7039f25617af10e36c644","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}